    "auto_merge": {
        "commit_message": "In PR https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/5030, an error was added to\n[`__Pyx_ApplySequenceOrMappingFlag`](https://github.com/cython/cython/blob/0fca25b1862663f33e23b7a4bbc9a72fabaa9eee/Cython/Utility/ExtensionTypes.c#L1016)\nfor pypy when `CYTHON_USE_TYPE_SPECS` is not active.\nThis breaks using PyPy and NumPy when using the default.\nPyPy has supported CYTHON_USE_TYPE_SPECS=1 in its releases for quite a while.\nI have been running Cython tests with that flag for as long as we have supported python3.8\n(at least May 2021), so there should be no users of pypy + cython where it will break.",
        "commit_title": "switch default CYTHON_USE_TYPE_SPECS on pypy to 1 (GH-7947)",
